  "title": "Ross Fil-Forn (Maltese Baked Rice)",
  "description": "Ross fil-forn is a classic Maltese baked rice dish baked with a beef and tomato sauce that's hearty, delicious, and full of Mediterranean flavors!",
  "authors": [
    "INGU"
  ],
